cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Optimal local laws and central limit theorem for the circular Riesz gas: a Lean 4 formalization"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/jboursier/circular-riesz-gas-lean"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of the main results of the paper
  "Optimal local laws and central limit theorem for the circular Riesz gas": near-optimal
  rigidity of gaps and interval counts, the variance expansion of singular linear statistics,
  and central limit theorems for singular linear statistics, interval counts, gaps and
  power-law observables, for every inverse temperature and every Riesz exponent in (0, 1).
  The library contains no sorry and no custom axiom, and each of the five main results has a
  Mathlib-only comparator challenge.
authors:
  - family-names: Boursier
    given-names: Jeanne
keywords:
  - Lean
  - mathlib
  - formal verification
  - Riesz gas
  - rigidity
  - central limit theorem
license: Apache-2.0
